metrics.sales: One row per line of a placed, not-cancelled order,
every name joined in.
  order_date      DATE          the depot's date of the order
  order_number    BIGINT        on the customer's paperwork
  channel         VARCHAR       how the order came in
  region          VARCHAR       the account's region today
  account         VARCHAR       the account's name today
  segment         VARCHAR       segment on the order's day
  account_manager VARCHAR       manager on the order's day
  sku             VARCHAR       product code, upper case, trimmed
  product         VARCHAR       the catalogue's name
  category        VARCHAR       the catalogue's category
  supplier        VARCHAR       procurement's name for it
  qty             INTEGER       units ordered
  unit_price      DECIMAL(18,2) dollars a unit, after discount
  revenue         DECIMAL(18,2) qty x unit_price
  cost            DECIMAL(18,2) qty x unit cost on the day
  gross_margin    DECIMAL(18,2) revenue - cost; NULL if no cost
Northeast 2025 by segment and category: 20 cells from the star,
  20 from the view, 0 differ; total $30,366,738.35
